    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners de Courcy O Dwyer are delighted to bring to the market this substantial family home which is nestled in this mature estate overlooking a large green area. \r\n\r\nThe extended accommodation comprises of entrance porch, entrance hall, living room, sitting room, dining room, kitchen / breakfast room, guest w.c., four bedrooms and garage.  The property is ideally positioned adjacent to the Crescent Shopping Centre and within walking distance of UHL and within close proximity to the city centre and Raheen Industrial Estate.\r\n\r\nOutside the property is further complimented with a very large enclosed mature rear garden and a front garden with off street parking and facing on to a large green area.\r\n\r\nA viewing of this property is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - \r\nHardwood entrance door. Under stairs storage. \r\n\r\nLiving Room - \r\nFeature tiled fireplace. Centre piece. Double doors to…\n\n\r\n\r\nSitting Room - \r\nCentre piece. Feature tiled fireplace.\r\n\r\nDining Room - \r\nAccess to rear via PVC door with double glazed glass inset.\r\n\r\nKitchen - \r\nFitted kitchen with array of eye and floor level units. Four cutlery drawers. Single drainer stainless steel sink unit with mixer tap. Plumbed for washing machine. \r\n\r\nBreakfast Room - \r\nFitted units.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - \r\nRange of fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nGuest W. C. - \r\nW. C. Wash hand basin.\r\n\r\nGarage - \r\nAluminium up and over door. \n\n\r\n\r\nUpstairs - \r\nLanding – hot press with dual immersion. Access to the attic via Stira staircase.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - \r\nRange of fitted wardrobes, vanity unit and overhead presses. TV point.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - \r\nFitted unit.\r\n\r\nShower Room - \r\nShower with Triton electric shower. W.C. Wash hand basin in vanity unit. Fully tiled walls and floor.\r\n\r\nOutside - \r\nFully hedged front garden. Part lawned. Driveway for two cars. Access via double steel gates.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Semi detached\r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nOil fired central heating\r\nFour bedrooms\r\nThree reception rooms\r\nLarge green area to the front\r\nSpacious accommodation\r\nOff street parking\r\nAdjacent to the Crescent Shopping Centre and University Hospital Limerick"
      },
